position=N/A | Basis: grep confirms exactly 5 functions at operations.py:2024 (_build_sections_index_from_body), 2170 (_filter_sections), 2297 (_build_sections_metadata), 2367 (_build_sections_compact), 2634 (_apply_body_section_filter). `_SECTION_BOUNDARY_RE` does NOT exist (grep, 0 hits) \u2014 confirms prior REFUTED finding still holds; Phase 1 is 5 functions, not 6.\\n4. Phase 2 functions: Evidence=AVAILABLE | Disposition=N/A | Basis: grep confirms exactly 5 functions at operations.py:2234 (_build_sections_from_yaml_item), 2472 (_paginate_body_result), 2531 (_populate_yaml_item_content), 2712 (_assemble_view_compact), 2821 (_assemble_view_content). `_build_sections_index` does NOT exist (only `_build_sections_index_from_body`, which is Phase 1) \u2014 confirms prior REFUTED finding still holds.\\n5. Phase 3 functions/constants: Evidence=AVAILABLE | Disposition=N/A | Basis: grep confirms server.py:204 (_VIEW_TOKEN_BUDGET), 209 (_token_count), 842 (_filter_view_sections), 1886 (_build_compact_manifest), 1963 (_build_over_budget_view) \u2014 4 functions + 1 constant. `_VIEW_BODY_CHARS_THRESHOLD` does NOT exist (0 grep hits); `full_chars` is computed inline, confirming prior REFUTED finding still holds.\\n6. Package identity: Evidence=AVAILABLE | Disposition=N/A | Basis: `plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/__init__.py` exists and performs package-relative imports (`from ._branch_delegates import ...`, `from .models import ...`).\\n7. Re-export strategy: Evidence=AVAILABLE | Disposition=N/A | Basis: item text specifies the exact import pattern; standard Python re-export via module-level `from backlog_core.section_filter import X` is a conventional, reversible, low-risk technique.\\n8. ADR target file path: Evidence=EVIDENCE-DERIVED | Disposition=N/A (resolved, not left to the item's either/or) | Basis: repo's own `.claude/CLAUDE.md` -> AGENTS.md \\\"Writing `.claude/rules/*.md` Files\\\" section states rules are \\\"the current requirement only \u2014 never pro